+				+ "the pips are at the BOTTOM, so the order never needed to change",
+				"h2 idx %d vs h0 idx %d" % [v2.get_index(), v0.get_index()])
+
+	# The ARITHMETIC and the CONTROLS must agree: the failure mode here is cards floating off
+	# their cells with every other check still green.
